    automated_test ""
    manual "measured 2026-08-20 with `cargo run --example issue_1021_languageless_probe`; output kept in docs/case-studies/issue-1021/logs/languageless-request-after.log -- the reported bare request is answered with the question about the language rather than with search results, and each of the four subjects-beyond-the-artefact prompts still routes elsewhere; measured again 2026-08-20 with `cargo run --example issue_1021_languageless_followup`, which asks the same bare request and then answers the question it comes back with -- output kept in docs/case-studies/issue-1021/logs/languageless-followup.log, showing the follow-up turn is answered from the catalog rather than asked again (finding 6)"
  requirement
    id "R1021-32"
